  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; tab-stops: left blank 168.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">중</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">학생부 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">환경분야</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 공동주택의 층간 소음은 예전부터 문제되어 왔고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">최근 환경부에서는 층간 소음 분쟁을 조정을 위한 소음 기준을 마련하기도 하였다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">하지만 이러한 행정적 통제 이외에 공동주택의 층간 소음을 슬기롭게 해결할 수 있는 방안을 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 과학적으로 탐구하시오</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. 이 문제의 출제 의도는 무엇일까요?<BR>층간 소음을 줄일 수 있는 과학기술적인 방법을 고안해 내는 것?<BR><BR>2. '슬기롭게'의 의도는?<BR><BR>3. 어떤 방안들이 있을까요?<BR></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 대회 주제이니 <FONT size=2 face=굴림>3번, 방안을 공론화하기는 좀 그렇지요^^ </FONT></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><FONT size=2 face=굴림><BR>제가 원하는 것은 1, 2번도 포함됩니다.<BR>같이 고민해주실래요? </FONT></SPAN></P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}